  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74e54f708689f07006b670977243b50177f72472.png\" alt=\"weapons_logo_big\">&nbsp;<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\"><br><br><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\" alt=\"space_gold\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>Project Babylon 是一個模組系列，致力於打造能協同運作的 RPG 生態系統。正如其名，「Weapons」為遊戲增添了大量武器。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8d02e08b8066928bbb09565ac8c2e5337f25d99.png\" alt=\"space_gold\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模組新增了什麼？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>12 種武器類型，每種武器皆擁有自訂的 3D 手工模型，適用於原版與自訂材質。<br>10 種新特效。<br>11 種新武器技能。<br>2 套武器動作集。<br>武器被動系統。<br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3414c5657ade00d6149c0697cc76f0d2903bee86.png\"><br><br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 必要依賴項：</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Babylon - Materials。</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Mod</a>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells and Spellbooks。</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib。</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-acg-battlescythe-revived\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ACG Battlescythe - Revived。</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Resurrection。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 選用依賴項：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles。</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為了讓模組正常運作，必須下載所有必要與選用依賴項中的模組。<br><br></strong><strong><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"189\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎查看好友製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，以獲得更多模型與內容！<br>也請支援由優秀團隊打造的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra Modpack</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen Modpack</a>。<br><br><br></strong><strong><br></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a8ad1d230b8024e6136522ac323c1350c6ee3052.png\" width=\"382\" height=\"139\"><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>預告片中展示的防具在哪裡？</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-babylon-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">就在這裡</a> :D</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請問 1.21.1 版本呢？</strong> 或許有一天吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>會後返嗎？</strong> 同上。</p>\n<p><strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" width=\"508\" height=\"118\"><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>回報錯誤請至此處：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1482312386139652248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482312386139652248</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>或前往：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2bc05122fec4f505ec4c72474e54599c2f6bc3d.png\"><br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 團隊開發了如此出色的模組與 API。</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>感謝 Yonchi Chikito 的支持。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 Epic Fight 社群，讓這個模組得以實現。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
